OL,3,GNEWSATikTok declines invite to discuss
OL,4,Adangerous driving videos
OL,5,
OL,6,FTikTok has declined an invitation to
OL,7,Fappear before an Irish parliamentary
OL,8,Fcommittee on media to discuss videos of
OL,9,Fpeople driving the wrong way down
OL,10,Fmotorways being posted.
OL,12,FFive teenagers were killed while
OL,13,Fdriving the wrong way down a motorway
OL,14,Fin County Kildare in the early hours of
OL,15,FSunday.
OL,17,FThe Irish child and family agency Tusla
OL,18,Fconfirmed on Thursday one of teenagers
OL,19,Fkilled in the crash was in its care and
OL,20,Ftwo were known to the agency.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
